          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_texture_synthesizer_fully_convolutio",
          "text": "The texture synthesizer is a fully-convolutional StyleGAN2 with all zero-padding removed, turning the structural latent, global style, and noise into a patch.",
