          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_padding_same_coordinate_always_yield",
          "text": "With no padding, the same coordinate always yields identical pixels, so independent patches tile seamlessly at constant memory. Training combines adversarial, R1, path-length, diversity, and vertical-coordinate regression losses.",
